              "content": {
                "content": "Locate the right side panel on the center console (passenger footwell area).\nWorking from top to bottom, carefully release the panel from the center console.\nPull gently — the panel is held by clips along its edge.\nSet the panel aside in a safe location.",
                "plainText": "Locate the right side panel on the center console (passenger footwell area).\nWorking from top to bottom, carefully release the panel from the center console.\nPull gently — the panel is held by clips along its edge.\nSet the panel aside in a safe location."
