              "height": 36,
              "content": {
                "content": "Remove Footwell Cover",
                "plainText": "Remove Footwell Cover"
              },
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "bold",
              "align": "center"
            },
            {
              "type": "divider",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 176,
              "width": 350,
              "height": 2,
              "thickness": 1,
              "color": "#e2e8f0"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 188,
              "width": 350,
              "height": 120,
              "content": {
                "content": "Release the push clips (or magnets) securing the front right footwell cover to the instrument panel.\nSupport the footwell cover as you release it — it has electrical connections.\nDisconnect the light connector by pressing the tab and pulling the plastic connector.\nDisconnect the speaker connector by angling it to release the small tab.\nMove the footwell cover aside.",
                "plainText": "Release the push clips (or magnets) securing the front right footwell cover to the instrument panel.\nSupport the footwell cover as you release it — it has electrical connections.\nDisconnect the light connector by pressing the tab and pulling the plastic connector.\nDisconnect the speaker connector by angling it to release the small tab.\nMove the footwell cover aside."
              },
              "fontSize": 15
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 318,
              "width": 350,
              "height": 64,
              "content": {
                "content": "Do NOT pull on the wires. Always grip and pull from the plastic connector body itself. Pulling wires can damage the connections.",
                "plainText": "Do NOT pull on the wires. Always grip and pull from the plastic connector body itself. Pulling wires can damage the connections."
              },
              "fontSize": 13,
              "color": "#555555"
            },
