                "plainText": "Locate the cabin filter cover on the HVAC module (now visible behind the removed footwell panel).\nUse your index finger and thumb to squeeze the two tabs at the bottom of the filter cover.\nTilt the cover outward to remove it.\nSet the cover aside."
