              "width": 350,
              "height": 142,
              "content": {
                "content": "There are TWO filters stacked inside the HVAC module (upper and lower).\nFold the upper cabin filter's pull tabs outward.\nHolding the tabs, carefully pull the upper filter straight out.\nBe careful not to snag nearby wiring connectors.\nThen pull the lower filter upward and out from the module.\nDispose of the old filters.",
                "plainText": "There are TWO filters stacked inside the HVAC module (upper and lower).\nFold the upper cabin filter's pull tabs outward.\nHolding the tabs, carefully pull the upper filter straight out.\nBe careful not to snag nearby wiring connectors.\nThen pull the lower filter upward and out from the module.\nDispose of the old filters."
              },
              "fontSize": 15
            },
